{"type":"thought","data":" not propagate to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate. The audit is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"now checking whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this contradicts the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Error Handling contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Codex section "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contains a paragraph"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that runs `_any_phase5_status`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the raw root component"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and refuses on unknown"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or active status. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paragraph appears before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the \"Closed in v1.6\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" note and is not marked"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as historical. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"audit is now checking"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether this contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the Error Handling "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Codex section "}
{"type":"thought","data":"explicitly states that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an arm-2 root-open "}
{"type":"thought","data":"OSError does not propagate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the gate. It then"}
{"type":"thought","data":" runs `_any_phase5_status`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the raw root component"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and refuses on unknown"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or active status. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradicts the Error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Handling contract, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"which requires refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regardless of phase.\n\nThe Codex root-refuse"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule is pinned by test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_codex_mode_000_root_refuses_whatever_the_phase`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" (mutation CX-ROOT-ENTER)."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" close the parity gap"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the Claude gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Codex contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is resolved. The enterability"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check runs before the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state walk, so the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"earlier paragraph's "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fallback only applies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when the root is traversable."}
{"type":"thought","data":" For mode 000, the v1.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal wins."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nMode 0311 is traversable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but not listable. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6 pre-check does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not fire because X_OK"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is true, so the earlier"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fallback paragraph "}
{"type":"thought","data":"applies. The design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"says the gate refuses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" judge-error under step5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and allows under step3"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for this case."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe paragraph before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the \"Closed in v1.6\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" note omits the pre-check."}
{"type":"thought","data":" An implementer might"}
{"type":"thought","data":" therefore apply the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fallback logic to all"}
{"type":"thought","data":" arm-2 cases, including"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mode 000, rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only to traversable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" roots."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Codex contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is resolved. The enterability"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pre-check runs before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the state walk, so "}
{"type":"thought","data":"both gates apply together"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than conflicting."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The historical text"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that claims the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not close the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"parity gap contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the \"Closed in v1.6\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" note. Unmarked historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paragraphs also leave"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the mode-000 refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to operator judgment.\n\nThe Error Handling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" summary omits the v1.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" enterability refusal,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the Detailed "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Design Codex section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains it. This creates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an adversarial inconsistency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between two sections."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Error Handling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" section is a required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design contract. Its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"only when governed\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" language excludes the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ungoverned mode-000"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal, so it must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be quoted as a contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit also notes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the history paragraph"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims the design does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not close the parity"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gap, while Open Questions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lists none and v1.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims it is closed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit now treats"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the unmarked historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" paragraphs as a single"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction. They"}
{"type":"thought","data":" appear after the \"Closed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in v1.6\" note but lack"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an end-of-history marker,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so they read as normative"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text. A task author"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would therefore treat"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the claim that the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design does not close"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the parity gap as the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actual decision."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit now structures"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the Codex root-refuse"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction as a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"single Must-fix. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document specifies "}
{"type":"thought","data":"three mutually exclusive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rules for non-enterable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" roots, so T2's gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and its tests cannot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be written from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" specification.\n\nA second"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Must-fix is identified:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the lexical `.` / `..`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exclusion is only present"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in version history,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not in the canonicaliser"}
{"type":"thought","data":" algorithm, T1 rewrite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list, or test plan,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet FR-1 step 2 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-3 require it."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA third Must-fix is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identified: the Test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Plan and AC-6.1 omit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec v1.6's unfixed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Codex deny on M-18 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"M-14, so tests would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assert the wrong unfixed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" observable. The audit"}
