{"type":"thought","data":" absence, the exact "}
{"type":"thought","data":"test plan line, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"checking design versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec on AC-3.3."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe test plan row "}
